# Security

Secrets only via environment variables, loaded through pydantic-settings as SecretStr.

Validate and normalize every URL input: http/https only, reject private, loopback, link-local and metadata IPs, reject embedded credentials.

Treat all scraped or agent-returned content as untrusted data: never execute, never interpolate into prompts as instructions, escape on render.

Agent goals must always include the stop-before-payment safety clause from sentinel.pipeline.goals.

CORS restricted to ALLOWED_ORIGINS. Rate-limit mutating endpoints.
